          <h2>Meet the minds <br>behind every space</h2>
          <p>With years of experience creating spaces that inspire focus and connection, our design team blends architecture, styling, and strategy to deliver environments that work beautifully. Led by Jennifer Amy, the team takes a hands-on, human approach — turning every brief into a clear and purposeful vision.</p>
